        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-04-20T14:56:48Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is a slightly different matrix, numerically, compared to computing the inverse of the device to global matrix directly. After running the chromium canary, it looks like that\u0027s enough to cause very imperceptible pixel diffs in some layout tests. This would end up blocking Skia\u0027s roll into chromium.\n\nGenerally, we have two ways of getting past this to rebase the layout tests. We can either first land a change to the TestExpectations file in chromium to suppress the failing tests, land this change and wait for it roll into chromium, and then make a chromium CL that undoes the suppression and includes the rebased images.\n\nAlternatively, we add a #define to `third_party/skia/SkUserConfig.h` in chromium like `SK_COMPUTE_DEV_TO_GLOBAL_INVERSE_DIRECTLY`, and then modify this CL to be something like:\n\n   SkM44 deviceToGlobal \u003d priorDevice-\u003edeviceToGlobal() * SkM44(newLayerMapping.layerToDevice());\n   #if defined(SK_COMPUTE_DEV_TO_GLOBAL_INVERSE_DIRECTLY)\n       deviceToGlobal.normalizePerspective();\n       SkM44 globalToDevice;\n       if (!deviceToGlobal(\u0026globalToDevice)) {\n          newDevice \u003d nullptr;\n          abortLayer();\n          return;\n       }\n   #else\n       SkM44 globalToDevice \u003d SkM44(newLayerMapping.deviceToLayer()) * priorDevice-\u003eglobalToDevice();\n   #endif\n   newDevice-\u003esetDeviceCoordinateSystem(deviceToGlobal, globalToDevice, ...);\n\nThen we land this and roll into chromium, which should then effectively be following the same operations as the old code. Then we delete the define from SkUserConfig.h in chromium and rebase the changed images.\n\nWhen that\u0027s done, I can come back and clean up the code to always do your optimization.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1119,
        "startChar": 16,
        "endLine": 1119,
        "endChar": 87
      },
      "revId": "c5decf009bdfb223c52dc79b3313cd906e0c3cc3",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
